# The Supabase project Hangar signs in against, syncs usage to and checks for
# updates on. Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill both in:
# Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API. Both values are public by design
# (row-level security protects the data, not the key), but they name your own
# backend, so they stay out of the repository.
#
# Without them the app builds and starts, but stops at a "No backend configured"
# screen. See "Backend (Supabase)" in the README for what the project needs.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
